ia, reliving the beauty of the things in the past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/843810/extras/04e3bd84329338862afc040d589ec602.poster.avif?t=1758611175\" width=600 height=357 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/843810/extras/04e3bd84329338862afc040d589ec602.webm?t=1758611175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/843810/extras/5ef742453016d8f5add3d9383752d63a.webp?t=1758611175\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br>A variety of mini games are designed in the game, such as the Mini 4WD race, the &quot;Gamicom&quot; console, the arcade, etc. Through these, players can enjoy the toys and games that were popular in China in the 1990s.<br><br>In the game, you can assemble a powerful Mini 4WD for yourself to challenge new tracks and all kinds of rivals, and finally become the town's king of Mini 4WD. You can also collect game cartridges and play mini-games on the &quot;Gamicom&quot; console, which might unlock some hidden stories or get you on the &quot;National Gamicom Rankings&quot;...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/843810/extras/317498f51b639e7898abd2c1f04d65b0.poster.avif?t=1758611175\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/843810/extras/317498f51b639e7898abd2c1f04d65b0.webm?t=1758611175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
